envelope: 1
uuid: nexus-export-macro-fiverr-gig-choose-delivery-v2
type: macro
id: fiverr-gig-choose-delivery-v2
context: Clear Glass → Settings → Macros
intent: >-
  Scope & Pricing: in the BASIC / STANDARD / PREMIUM column named by {{tier}}, open the DELIVERY
  TIME dropdown and pick {{delivery}} (e.g. "3 Days"). What _gigFill does for each *.delivery part.
  v2 (0.60.280): gated. After the pick, the gate checks that this column's dropdown shows
  {{delivery}}; if not, the pick runs again (2 retries). Edit `pick` (auto, pointer, keys, number)
  or add `keysFor` to bind keys to each value, e.g. "3": "Down Down Down Enter".
# 0.60.280 KB6: a copy of v1 that was never edited (its fingerprint is listed here) is upgraded to this; an edited one stays his
supersedes:
  - c4e22f7fde7d67ff
summary: 2 browser steps for fiverr.com, the pick gated on the value shown; asks for tier, delivery
system: clear-glass.automation
tags:
  - macro
  - step:wait_for
  - step:choose
  - gated
exported_at: 1793207566450
